</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>timeout_ms</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Time budget in milliseconds used to classify elapsed time. Defaults to <computeroutput>kDefaultRenderTimeout.count()</computeroutput> (30 000). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
